# .gitignore — SRL-2015 training-session asset folder
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This folder is the COMPLETE forensic recording. Most of it is raw tool
# output and large binaries that must NOT enter git history:
#   - tool-output JSON (volatility pslist/netscan/svcscan/malfind, evtx, ...)
#   - screencast videos / asciinema casts
#   - the raw action log + transcript (real case data / PII:
#     hostnames nfury/tdungan/nromanoff, internal 10.3.58.x IPs, C2 IPs)
#
# Only the curated, human-readable docs are committed (see the !negations).
# For the video in GitLab, use Git LFS or attach to a GitLab Release.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw MCP tool-output JSON (all of it; none is curated) ---
*.json

# --- Screencast videos + asciinema casts ---
*.mp4
*.gif
*.cast

# --- Raw action log + rendered transcripts (case data / PII) ---
session-actions.log
*.transcript.txt

# --- Operational run-scripts + step scaffolding (reproducible, not docs) ---
*.sh
_step.sh
*.py

# --- Workflow completion markers / scratch dotfiles ---
.*_done
.*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KEEP these (curated documentation) — negations must come last
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!ATTACK-CHAIN-WORKFLOW.md
